#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"First install `qiskit-ibm-transpiler` with some extra dependencies as "
"follows:\n"
msgstr ""
"Nejprve nainstaluj `qiskit-ibm-transpiler` s některými dalšími závislostmi "
